uv venv is a command used to create isolated Python virtual environment

in python we have centralized environment called base environment unlike in js we have seprate isolated environment for each project and depedencies installed in node_moudles 


so if we also do isloated enviroment in python then run the command :uv venv

<!-- steps to use use  -->


install uv :pip install uv 

create virtual environment :uv venv or python -m uv venv

Activate the Environment:To tell your terminal to use this specific project environment instead of your global Python

install dependecies: uv pip install depdencies or python -m uv pip install depdencies


